ressuring women to drop complaints of sexual assaults - so the cops could massage their crime figures down _ ie, the official figures for rape and sex assault in Britain are artificially low:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;here&amp;#39;s that link http://www.guardian.co.uk/uk/2013/feb/26/police-failed-investigate-sex-attacks&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;but searching for it, I found a story and an eyewash report to calm the gullible - of a British sex predator in blue costume&lt;br /&gt;http://www.bbc.co.uk/news/uk-england-12154627&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;and .pdf of the eyewash&lt;br /&gt;http://www.ipcc.gov.uk/Documents/investigation_commissioner_reports/abuse_of_police_powers_to_perpetrate_sexual_violence.PDF&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7056773770576294297/comments/default/7114714334973859279'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7056773770576294297/comments/default/7114714334973859279'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/03/the-stalinist-in-white-house.html?showComment=1362686923857#c7114714334973859279' title=''/><author><name>Keith</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/03/the-stalinist-in-white-house.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7056773770576294297' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7056773770576294297' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1222599393"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 7, 2013 at 1:08 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1566021490836091943</id><published>2013-03-07T11:22:13.496-07:00</p